## Per-product notes

**Badger Maps** — route-planning-first. Route optimization (up to ~20% less drive time), map-based account/lead/territory visualization, time+location-stamped check-ins. CRM integrations (Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoho, Dynamics 365, NetSuite). Lighter on task/goal assignment than the others.

**SPOTIO** — activity-and-accountability-first. One-tap activity logging with GPS/timestamp verification, Drop Pins, GPS Breadcrumbs, Visit Audit Log, geofenced check-in/out, sales leaderboards, real-time goal tracking, territory analytics for balanced workload, "DASH" AI co-pilot for auto-drafting visit notes.

**Repsly** — retail-execution-first (CPG/merchandising). Scheduling + territory coverage + GPS check-in, remote check-in for off-site work, AI photo recognition for shelf audits, execution alerts against a visit cadence goal, digital audits and in-app order collection.

**Zenput** — task/compliance-first, less about rep location and more about location (store) compliance. Central task assignment across many locations, photo-evidence checklists, real-time completion-rate dashboards, automated corrective-action follow-ups.

**LeadSquared (Field Force Automation)** — attendance/geofencing-heavy. Workday templates with auto check-in if the rep is in the right place at the right time, strict geofencing to prevent fraudulent check-ins/meeting notes, geo-tracking with distance-traveled + location history.

**BeatRoute** — enterprise FMCG/retail SFA + distributor management. Beat/territory planning with visit-frequency and store-hour constraints, AI route optimization, real-time deviation alerts, shelf-share/planogram AI audits, KPI scorecards, several "AI agent" copilots (order, scheduling, customer insights).

**SalesRabbit** — door-to-door/canvassing-first. Rep-drawn custom territories assignable by managers, route optimization, plus a dedicated gamification module ("Amplify": battles, badges, redeemable coin rewards, leaderboards).

**TrackoField** — full field-employee-tracking suite, India-market-oriented. Real-time GPS + route history playback, territory-wise performance, geofence-violation tracking, proximity/skill-based task auto-allocation, AI face-recognition attendance, expense capture with hierarchy-based approval, "Target vs Achievement" goal report, offline capture, voice notes.

**Lystloc / Unolo** — similar India-market field-force suite. Custom multi-coordinate geofenced zones, live location + route/distance travelled, geo-fenced attendance, task status and total working hours tracking.

**Others mentioned in search but not deep-dived**: AllGeo, FieldServicely, B2Field, TrackObit, Fieldproxy — same core feature set (live GPS map, geofenced client addresses, task assignment, visit notes/photos), positioned as lower-cost/SMB alternatives to the above.

