## Scoping takeaway for the customer's tablet app

The customer's ask ("track all their activities including but not limited to location, assign tasks, goals, and zones") maps directly onto this category's baseline feature set. A v1 that would be competitive needs at minimum:

1. Live map + GPS breadcrumbs for every rep
2. Geofenced zones/territories, drawable by a manager, with violation alerts
3. Task assignment (one-off + recurring) with due dates and completion tracking
4. Goal/KPI targets per rep with a "target vs. achievement" report
5. Visit check-in/check-out tied to the geofence, with notes + photo capture
6. Manager dashboard with leaderboards and drill-down reports
7. Offline capture with sync-on-reconnect (tablets in the field will lose signal)

Everything past that (AI photo/shelf recognition, gamification, AI copilots, distributor management) is differentiation, not table stakes — worth deferring to a later phase.
